rg/2026/07/21/ice-arrests-reach-new-high/","author":["[[Tim Henderson]]"],"published":"2026-07-21","created":"2026-07-31","description":"Immigration arrests reached 1,593 per day in early July in a new push to detain and deport immigrants that has led to deaths in traffic stops. There were more than 43,000 arrests in June, the highest recorded by the Trump administration, according to statistics released Monday by U.S. Immigration and Customs Enforcement reflecting new bookings into detention facilities."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},